{"path":"/services/search-ai-visibility/","slug":"services__search-ai-visibility","kind":"service","title":"Freight Forwarders | Customs & Dray Automation | KlearNow","description":"Unlock AI-driven workflows, from document intake all the way through dray and inland trucking.","source":"live","stylesheets":["/_astro/global.Btqt_PqA.css","/_astro/Base.D9X9tJbq.css","/_astro/ConsentBanner.Bjqg_HPr.css","/_astro/FaqSection.BU63QfoB.css","/_astro/ServiceLayout.DWPKQstD.css"],"scripts":["/_astro/Nav.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BTi8Y4C0.js","/_astro/Footer.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.QLgbxcz6.js","/_astro/ConsentBanner.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BlWZOVqD.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BUtqXeGZ.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_1_lang.s69FG7Vr.js"],"mainHtml":"<section class=\"svc-hero\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"svc-hero__tex\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/secondary-hero.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></div><div class=\"container svc-hero__inner\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Services</span><h1 class=\"svc-hero__title\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>AI Visibility Agency, Measured Monthly</h1><p class=\"svc-hero__sub\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Find out where buyers encounter your brand in search and AI answers. We audit the site, improve relevant pages and track citations alongside search traffic and enquiries, with a dated record of what changed.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--blue\" href=\"/get-in-touch/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get Your AI Visibility Read</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div></section><section class=\"page-brief\" data-astro-cid-onysphra><div class=\"container page-brief__inner\" data-astro-cid-onysphra><div data-astro-cid-onysphra><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-onysphra>Scope and evidence</span><h2 data-astro-cid-onysphra>What does an AI visibility agency do?</h2></div><div class=\"page-brief__body\" data-astro-cid-onysphra><p data-astro-cid-onysphra>An AI visibility agency checks whether relevant answers mention or cite your brand, investigates the sources behind those answers, and improves the website and content where evidence supports a change. Our work combines technical SEO, answer engine optimisation and a dated record of rankings, citations and enquiries.</p><ul data-astro-cid-onysphra><li data-astro-cid-onysphra><a href=\"/ai-visibility-index/\" data-astro-cid-onysphra>Read our July AI Visibility Index<span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-onysphra> ↗</span></a></li><li data-astro-cid-onysphra><a href=\"/aeo-agency/\" data-astro-cid-onysphra>Compare agency work and software<span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-onysphra> ↗</span></a></li></ul></div></div></section><section class=\"section evo\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__head\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>One Measured Discipline</span><h2 class=\"evo__heading\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Why Rankings Alone No Longer Fill the Pipeline</h2></div><div class=\"evo__grid\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__col\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__colhead\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"evo__kicker\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Problem</span><span class=\"evo__coltitle\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Standard Agency</span></div><div class=\"evo__cards\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 12V5.74853C20 5.5894 19.9368 5.43679 19.8243 5.32426L16.6757 2.17574C16.5632 2.06321 16.4106 2 16.2515 2H4.6C4.26863 2 4 2.26863 4 2.6V21.4C4 21.7314 4.26863 22 4.6 22H11\"/><path d=\"M8 10H16M8 6H12M8 14H11\"/><path d=\"M20.5 20.5L22 22\"/><path d=\"M15 18C15 19.6569 16.3431 21 18 21C18.8299 21 19.581 20.663 20.1241 20.1185C20.6654 19.5758 21 18.827 21 18C21 16.3431 19.6569 15 18 15C16.3431 15 15 16.3431 15 18Z\"/><path d=\"M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The AI answer names a competitor</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Traditional SEO chases positions on a results page. Meanwhile buyers ask ChatGPT and Perplexity, and the answer either names you or it names someone else. Most programmes never look.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M1 20V19C1 15.134 4.13401 12 8 12V12C11.866 12 15 15.134 15 19V20\"/><path d=\"M13 14V14C13 11.2386 15.2386 9 18 9V9C20.7614 9 23 11.2386 23 14V14.5\"/><path d=\"M8 12C10.2091 12 12 10.2091 12 8C12 5.79086 10.2091 4 8 4C5.79086 4 4 5.79086 4 8C4 10.2091 5.79086 12 8 12Z\"/><path d=\"M18 9C19.6569 9 21 7.65685 21 6C21 4.34315 19.6569 3 18 3C16.3431 3 15 4.34315 15 6C15 7.65685 16.3431 9 18 9Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>SEO and AI visibility sit with two vendors</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>SEO sits with one specialist while AI visibility gets pitched as a separate service by another. Two roadmaps compete for the same pages, and neither owns the outcome.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M18.5 15L5.5 15\"/><path d=\"M16 4L8 4\"/><path d=\"M9 4.5L9 10.2602C9 10.7376 8.82922 11.1992 8.51851 11.5617L3.48149 17.4383C3.17078 17.8008 3 18.2624 3 18.7398V19C3 20.1046 3.89543 21 5 21L19 21C20.1046 21 21 20.1046 21 19V18.7398C21 18.2624 20.8292 17.8008 20.5185 17.4383L15.4815 11.5617C15.1708 11.1992 15 10.7376 15 10.2602L15 4.5\"/><path d=\"M12 9.01L12.01 8.99889\"/><path d=\"M11 2.01L11.01 1.99889\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Nobody shows you where you are actually cited</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Agencies say the work helps AI visibility but never show where you are actually cited. Without measurement, you are buying a story.</p></article></div></div><div class=\"evo__col\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__colhead\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"evo__kicker\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Solution</span><span class=\"evo__coltitle evo__coltitle--brand\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><img src=\"/img/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"evo__logo\" width=\"57\" height=\"57\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Legency Approach</span></span></div><div class=\"evo__cards evo__cards--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></div><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5.21173 15.1113L2.52473 12.4243C2.29041 12.1899 2.29041 11.8101 2.52473 11.5757L5.21173 8.88873C5.44605 8.65442 5.82595 8.65442 6.06026 8.88873L8.74727 11.5757C8.98158 11.8101 8.98158 12.1899 8.74727 12.4243L6.06026 15.1113C5.82595 15.3456 5.44605 15.3456 5.21173 15.1113Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 21.475L8.88874 18.788C8.65443 18.5537 8.65443 18.1738 8.88874 17.9395L11.5757 15.2525C11.8101 15.0182 12.19 15.0182 12.4243 15.2525L15.1113 17.9395C15.3456 18.1738 15.3456 18.5537 15.1113 18.788L12.4243 21.475C12.19 21.7094 11.8101 21.7094 11.5757 21.475Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 8.7475L8.88874 6.06049C8.65443 5.82618 8.65443 5.44628 8.88874 5.21197L11.5757 2.52496C11.8101 2.29065 12.19 2.29065 12.4243 2.52496L15.1113 5.21197C15.3456 5.44628 15.3456 5.82618 15.1113 6.06049L12.4243 8.7475C12.19 8.98181 11.8101 8.98181 11.5757 8.7475Z\"/><path d=\"M17.9396 15.1113L15.2526 12.4243C15.0183 12.1899 15.0183 11.8101 15.2526 11.5757L17.9396 8.88873C18.174 8.65442 18.5539 8.65442 18.7882 8.88873L21.4752 11.5757C21.7095 11.8101 21.7095 12.1899 21.4752 12.4243L18.7882 15.1113C18.5539 15.3456 18.174 15.3456 17.9396 15.1113Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>One programme feeds both surfaces</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>SEO and answer engine optimization run as a single programme. The same pages, schema and authority work feed both, so effort compounds instead of competing.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M14 14V6M14 14L20.1023 17.487C20.5023 17.7156 21 17.4268 21 16.9661V3.03391C21 2.57321 20.5023 2.28439 20.1023 2.51296L14 6M14 14H7C4.79086 14 3 12.2091 3 10V10C3 7.79086 4.79086 6 7 6H14\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M7.75716 19.3001L7 14H11L11.6772 18.7401C11.8476 19.9329 10.922 21 9.71716 21C8.73186 21 7.8965 20.2755 7.75716 19.3001Z\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>You see the citation count every month</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Every month we check where you appear in ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini and Claude, and who appears instead. ChannelSight is now the most-cited domain in its own answer set, at 16 of 56 answers.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9 21H15M9 21V16M9 21H3.6C3.26863 21 3 20.7314 3 20.4V16.6C3 16.2686 3.26863 16 3.6 16H9M15 21V9M15 21H20.4C20.7314 21 21 20.7314 21 20.4V3.6C21 3.26863 20.7314 3 20.4 3H15.6C15.2686 3 15 3.26863 15 3.6V9M15 9H9.6C9.26863 9 9 9.26863 9 9.6V16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Rankings, citations and AI traffic on one page</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Rankings, citations and AI-referred traffic land in one monthly report your board can read without translation. You see movement, or you see us change the plan.</p><ul class=\"evo-logos\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><li data-astro-cid-asdozulm><img src=\"/img/engines/chatgpt.svg\" alt=\"ChatGPT\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></li><li data-astro-cid-asdozulm><img src=\"/img/engines/perplexity.svg\" alt=\"Perplexity\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></li><li data-astro-cid-asdozulm><img src=\"/img/engines/gemini.svg\" alt=\"Gemini\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></li><li data-astro-cid-asdozulm><img src=\"/img/engines/claude.svg\" alt=\"Claude\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></li></ul></article></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section foundation\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div class=\"foundation__head\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>AI SEO Agency Services</span><h2 class=\"foundation__heading\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Four Things That Decide Whether You Are Cited</h2></div></div><div class=\"foundation__grid\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 12V5.74853C20 5.5894 19.9368 5.43679 19.8243 5.32426L16.6757 2.17574C16.5632 2.06321 16.4106 2 16.2515 2H4.6C4.26863 2 4 2.26863 4 2.6V21.4C4 21.7314 4.26863 22 4.6 22H11\"/><path d=\"M8 10H16M8 6H12M8 14H11\"/><path d=\"M17.9541 16.9394L18.9541 15.9394C19.392 15.5015 20.102 15.5015 20.5399 15.9394V15.9394C20.9778 16.3773 20.9778 17.0873 20.5399 17.5252L19.5399 18.5252M17.9541 16.9394L14.963 19.9305C14.8131 20.0804 14.7147 20.2741 14.6821 20.4835L14.4394 22.0399L15.9957 21.7973C16.2052 21.7646 16.3988 21.6662 16.5487 21.5163L19.5399 18.5252M17.9541 16.9394L19.5399 18.5252\"/><path d=\"M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Pages Written to Be Quoted</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Question-led pages that answer what buyers actually ask, in the first sentences. Written to be quoted by engines and useful to humans, and refreshed on a set cycle.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9.00001 21L8.00001 21C6.89544 21 6.00001 20.1057 6.00001 19.0011C6.00001 17.4501 6.00001 15.3443 6 14C6 13 4.5 12 4.5 12C4.5 12 6.00001 11 6.00001 10C6.00001 8.827 6.00001 6.62207 6.00001 4.99914C6.00001 3.89457 6.89544 3 8.00001 3L9.00001 3\"/><path d=\"M15 21L16 21C17.1046 21 18 20.1057 18 19.0011C18 17.4501 18 15.3443 18 14C18 13 19.5 12 19.5 12C19.5 12 18 11 18 10C18 8.827 18 6.62207 18 4.99914C18 3.89457 17.1046 3 16 3L15 3\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>A Site Engines Can Read</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Schema on every page type, clean semantic structure, fast pages and a machine-readable site. The unglamorous layer that decides whether engines can read you at all.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M14.2718 10.445L18 2M9.31612 10.6323L5 2M12.7615 10.0479L8.835 2M14.36 2L13.32 4.5M6 16C6 19.3137 8.68629 22 12 22C15.3137 22 18 19.3137 18 16C18 12.6863 15.3137 10 12 10C8.68629 10 6 12.6863 6 16Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Authority Built Off-Site as Well as On</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Bylines tied to real author entities, and a citation plan that earns mentions on the sites engines already trust. Authority is built off-site as much as on it.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 20H4V4\"/><path d=\"M4 16.5L12 9L15 12L19.5 7.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>A Citation Count Every Month</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Monthly citation checks across four AI engines, plus rankings and AI-referred sessions in analytics. Every recommendation traces back to a number you can show upward.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"page-brief\" id=\"webflow-aeo\" data-astro-cid-onysphra><div class=\"container page-brief__inner\" data-astro-cid-onysphra><div data-astro-cid-onysphra><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-onysphra>Your existing tools</span><h2 data-astro-cid-onysphra>Working alongside Webflow AEO</h2></div><div class=\"page-brief__body\" data-astro-cid-onysphra><p data-astro-cid-onysphra>Webflow AEO can track prompts and citations across ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini and Claude. If your team uses it, we agree which questions, markets and reporting periods matter to your buyers. Legency reviews the evidence, prioritises the work and implements the website changes. Your monthly report records those changes alongside search performance, citations and enquiries, with the source and method stated for each measure.</p><ul data-astro-cid-onysphra><li data-astro-cid-onysphra><a href=\"https://help.webflow.com/hc/en-us/articles/51704299506195-AEO-analytics-overview\" data-astro-cid-onysphra>See Webflow’s AEO analytics<span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-onysphra> ↗</span></a></li></ul></div></div></section><section class=\"section dp\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn><div class=\"container dp__head\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn>Two Surfaces</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn>Your Buyers Now Search in Two Places at Once</h2><p class=\"dp__sub\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn>The same person will type a query into Google and ask an assistant the same question an hour later, and the two return different companies. Running one discipline against both is the only way the answers stop contradicting each other. Our <a href=\"/ai-visibility-index/\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn>AI Visibility Index</a> shows what that gap looks like across a whole category.</p></div><div class=\"container dp__cards\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn><h3 data-astro-cid-thdesxtn>What a search engine rewards</h3><p data-astro-cid-thdesxtn>A page that deserves a position: matched intent, real depth, links from places that matter, and a technical layer that lets a crawler reach it. Success is a rank and a click, and the click is the only way the visit ever reaches you.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn><h3 data-astro-cid-thdesxtn>What an answer engine rewards</h3><p data-astro-cid-thdesxtn>A passage worth quoting: a question as the heading, an answer under it, short self-contained sentences, and a source behind any figure. Success is being the source inside an answer, which happens whether or not anybody clicks.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"section dp dp--alt\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn><div class=\"container dp__head\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn>The Overlap</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn>Why Running Them Separately Costs You Twice</h2></div><div class=\"container dp__cards dp__cards--three\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn><h3 data-astro-cid-thdesxtn>The same pages</h3><p data-astro-cid-thdesxtn>Both disciplines want the same twenty pages fixed. Split across two vendors, those pages get edited twice, in two directions, and each vendor reports the movement the other caused.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn><h3 data-astro-cid-thdesxtn>The same technical layer</h3><p data-astro-cid-thdesxtn>Crawlability, structure, speed and clean markup decide whether either surface can use your site. It is one job. Paying for it twice is the most common waste we find on arriving.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn><h3 data-astro-cid-thdesxtn>The same authority</h3><p data-astro-cid-thdesxtn>Being cited elsewhere lifts both. A mention on a source an engine already trusts helps the answer and the ranking, and no one has ever needed two separate plans to earn it.</p></article></div><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn><p class=\"dp__foot\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn>The measurement is where they differ, and that is the part most programmes skip: rankings and clicks on one side, citation counts across four engines on the other, in one monthly report.</p></div></section><section class=\"section dp\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn><div class=\"container dp__head\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn>The Month</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn>What a Month of the Programme Contains</h2></div><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn><ol class=\"dp__steps\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn><li class=\"dp__step\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn><span class=\"dp__num\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn>01</span><div data-astro-cid-thdesxtn><h3 data-astro-cid-thdesxtn>Measure both surfaces</h3><p data-astro-cid-thdesxtn>Rankings and clicks from Search Console, and a citation panel run across ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini and Claude on a fixed question set. Same questions every month, so month-on-month movement is comparable rather than a fresh snapshot each time.</p></div></li><li class=\"dp__step\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn><span class=\"dp__num\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn>02</span><div data-astro-cid-thdesxtn><h3 data-astro-cid-thdesxtn>Fix the pages that lose on both</h3><p data-astro-cid-thdesxtn>The pages that neither rank nor get quoted are the ones that get rebuilt first, because the same work fixes both. Question-led headings, an answer directly beneath, sources behind the figures, and the technical faults cleared while we are in there.</p></div></li><li class=\"dp__step\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn><span class=\"dp__num\" data-astro-cid-thdesxtn>03</span><div data-astro-cid-thdesxtn><h3 data-astro-cid-thdesxtn>Report what moved and what did not</h3><p data-astro-cid-thdesxtn>One document covering both surfaces, with the method behind every number and an explicit note where an engine was too unstable across its own runs to support a claim. The plan changes on that evidence rather than on a quarterly instinct.</p></div></li></ol></div></section><section class=\"caseband\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><div class=\"pixelated-scroll-transition\" data-pixelated-scroll-transition data-columns=\"24\" data-columns-tablet=\"18\" data-columns-mobile=\"10\" data-rows=\"8\" data-mode=\"reveal\" style=\"color:var(--bg)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"caseband__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></div><div class=\"container caseband__inner\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><div class=\"caseband__content\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>Case Study</span><span class=\"caseband__chip\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><img src=\"/img/partners/blueflame-2026.svg\" alt=\"Blueflame AI\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></span><h2 class=\"caseband__heading\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>Organic search now brings Blueflame more demo requests than paid.</h2><p class=\"caseband__text\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>Eighteen months of content, technical and authority work, all reported in one monthly format. Organic search now brings Blueflame more demo requests than paid search does, and AI citations are tracked monthly across four engines.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/case-studies/blueflame-ai/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>View Case Study</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div><div class=\"caseband__media\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><img src=\"/img/case-studies/blueflame-photo-oct2026-1440.webp\" alt=\"Blueflame’s new homepage and logo on an Apple Studio Display in a city office.\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></div></div></section><section class=\"ctaband\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><div class=\"ctaband__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz></div><div class=\"container ctaband__inner\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><div class=\"ctaband__text\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>One Discipline</span><h2 class=\"ctaband__heading\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>See Both Surfaces on One Page</h2><p class=\"ctaband__body\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Rankings and citations, measured together, in one monthly document. A call about how the two surfaces are working for you today and what running them as one discipline would change.</p></div><div class=\"ctaband__side\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><ul class=\"ctaband__points\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Search Console performance beside a citation panel across four AI engines</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>The pages that lose on both, which are the cheapest ones to fix</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>One report a marketing lead can send upward without rewriting it</li></ul><div class=\"ctaband__actions\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/get-in-touch/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get Your AI Visibility Read</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a><a class=\"ctaband__quiet\" href=\"/aeo-agency/\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>How we measure AI citations</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section faq\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__head\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Common Questions</span><h2 class=\"faq__heading\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Frequently Asked<br data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Questions</h2></div><div class=\"faq__list\" data-faq data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-0\" id=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>What is answer engine optimization?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-0\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Answer engine optimization (AEO) is the practice of making your content the answer AI assistants give when buyers ask questions. It covers how pages are written, how the site is structured, and how much the engines trust your brand. Most of it is disciplined content and technical work, aimed at being the company the answer names.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-1\" id=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>How do you measure AI visibility?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Every month we run the questions that matter to your business through ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini and Claude, and record whether you are cited, who is cited instead, and how that changes over time. Alongside that, we segment AI-referred sessions in your analytics. Both land in the monthly report as numbers a board can read.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-2\" id=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>AEO vs SEO - what&#39;s the difference?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>SEO earns positions on a search results page; AEO earns a place inside the answer an AI assistant gives. They draw on the same foundations of clear content, sound structure and real authority, so we run them as one programme rather than two. The measurement differs: rankings for one, citations for the other.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-3\" id=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Which AI engines do you track?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini and Claude, checked monthly on a fixed question set. We keep the questions, dates, engines and cited sources with each report, so you can see what was measured and compare equivalent checks over time.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-4\" id=\"faq-btn-4\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Is AI SEO the same as AEO and GEO?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-4\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-4\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>The terms overlap and are used inconsistently. AI SEO usually describes SEO work intended to improve visibility in AI search. AEO focuses on direct answers, while GEO describes visibility in generated responses. We scope the actual content, technical and authority work, then report rankings, citations and enquiries separately.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>","inlineStyles":[".transition {\n          display: none;\n        }",".page-brief[data-astro-cid-onysphra]{background:var(--white,#fff);border-block:1px solid #0c0c141f;padding-block:clamp(2rem,5vw,4.5rem)}.page-brief__inner[data-astro-cid-onysphra]{grid-template-columns:1fr 1.25fr;gap:clamp(1.5rem,5vw,5rem);display:grid}h2[data-astro-cid-onysphra]{max-width:20ch;margin-top:.75rem;font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.5rem);line-height:1.15}p[data-astro-cid-onysphra]{max-width:65ch;margin:0;font-size:clamp(1rem,1.4vw,1.125rem);line-height:1.65}ul[data-astro-cid-onysphra]{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem 1.5rem;margin:1.25rem 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none;display:flex}a[data-astro-cid-onysphra]{color:var(--blue);text-underline-offset:.2em;padding-block:.5rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:underline;display:inline-block}a[data-astro-cid-onysphra]:focus-visible{outline-offset:4px;outline:2px solid}@media (width<=760px){.page-brief__inner[data-astro-cid-onysphra]{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.dp__grid[data-astro-cid-thdesxtn]{gap:var(--sp-5);grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);align-items:center;display:grid}.dp__heading[data-astro-cid-thdesxtn]{font-size:var(--h4);margin-bottom:var(--sp-3);max-width:24ch}.dp__text[data-astro-cid-thdesxtn] p[data-astro-cid-thdesxtn],.dp__sub[data-astro-cid-thdesxtn]{font-size:var(--para-sm);max-width:56ch;margin-bottom:var(--sp-2)}.dp__note[data-astro-cid-thdesxtn]{opacity:.7}.dp__head[data-astro-cid-thdesxtn]{margin-bottom:var(--sp-4);max-width:64ch}.dp--alt[data-astro-cid-thdesxtn]{background:var(--white)}.dp__car